er.\nThe Barrens orange\nlvl 20–23\nThunderheads, Stormhides, Hecklefang Stalkers and Zhevra Coursers around Field of Giants, Blackthorn Ridge and Camp Taurajo. Medium and Heavy Leather.\n\nBeast spots are from the original game and may differ in Forever.\n\nNext unlock: Heavy Leather at 125.\n\nHeavy Hide needs 125\nadd price\nThe Barrens, Stonetalon Mountains, Ashenvale +2 · today +12%\nHeavy Leather needs 125\n11s 35c\n~4g 4s/hr\nThe Barrens, Stonetalon Mountains, Ashenvale +2 · today +12%\nGreen Whelp Scale orange\nadd price\nNot in your zones · today −4%\nBlack Whelp Scale orange\nadd price\nNot in your zones · today −12%\nMedium Hide yellow\nadd price\nSilverpine Forest, The Barrens, Stonetalon Mountains +3 · today −4%\nMedium Leather yellow\n3s 89c\n~1g 38s/hr\nSilverpine Forest, The Barrens, Stonetalon Mountains +3 · today −4%\nDeviate Scale yellow\nadd price\nThe Barrens · today −12%\nRuined Leather Scraps gray\nadd price\nDurotar, Mulgore, Tirisfal Glades +6 · today −12%\nLight Hide gray\nadd price\nDurotar, Mulgore, Tirisfal Glades +6 · today −12%\nLight Leather gray\nadd price\nDurotar, Mulgore, Tirisfal Glades +6 · today −12%\n\nNode data follows Wowhead's Forever data where published. Zones marked (est.) are new Forever zones whose nodes aren't charted yet, so their herbs and ores are a best guess for their level.\n\nGold per hour is a rough guide: about 35 herb nodes, 25 skins or 20 mining nodes an hour, after the auction house cut.",
